// Every way the lifter reconciles a call site with a disagreeing declaration
// is reported.  By default the reports are warnings and the lift completes;
// under -strict each one is an error and nothing is lowered.
//
//   ext_short(a)            declared (int, int): one zero argument synthesized
//   ext_extra(a, b, 42)     declared (int, int): declaration promoted to variadic
//   ext_void(a) -> int      declared void:       return type taken from the call
//   ext_bad(a, <bad>, b)    one argument cannot be built: the call is dropped,
//                           not emitted with `b` shifted into parameter 1
//   EXTERNAL:0000dead(a)    unknown callee: replaced by __patchestry_error
//
// RUN: bash %strip-json-comments %s > %t.json
// RUN: %patchir-decomp -input %t.json -emit-cir -print-tu -output %t > %t.log 2>&1
// RUN: %file-check -vv -check-prefix=WARN %s --input-file %t.log
// RUN: %file-check -vv -check-prefix=C %s --input-file %t.c
// RUN: not %patchir-decomp -input %t.json -emit-cir -strict -output %t.strict > %t.strict.log 2>&1
// RUN: %file-check -vv -check-prefix=ERR %s --input-file %t.strict.log
// RUN: test ! -e %t.strict.cir
//
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-arg-synthesized]: 1 of 2 required args missing at the call site and filled with zero values in call to 'ext_short'
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-variadic-promoted]: 3 args but the declaration has 2 params; declaration promoted to variadic in call to 'ext_extra'
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-prototype-rebuilt]: declared return type void replaced by call-site type 'unsigned int' in call to 'ext_void'
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [op-dropped]: CALL operation 'call_bad' in function 'call_reconcile_reports' produced no statement
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-callee-missing]: callee 'EXTERNAL:0000dead' is not a known function; call replaced by __patchestry_error and its 1 args discarded
// WARN-NOT: Diag Error
//
// C-DAG: ext_short(a, 0U)
// C-DAG: ext_extra(a, b, 42U)
// C-DAG: ext_void(a)
// C-DAG: __patchestry_error("missing_call_EXTERNAL_0000dead")
// C-NOT: ext_bad(a
//
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-arg-synthesized]
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-variadic-promoted]
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-prototype-rebuilt]
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [op-dropped]
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [call-callee-missing]
// ERR: Skipping code generation due to prior diagnostics errors
